A L G O L - Г Д P
    (7.01.82)

     1.     ′BEGIN′
     2.         ′COMMENT′ UNDECLARED AND TWICE DECLARED IDENTIFIERS;
     3.         ′INTEGER′ I, I;
     4.         ′REAL′ X;
     5.         X := Y;
     6.         Z[1] := 0;
     7.         P(X);
     8.         ′GOTO′ NOWHERE;
     9.     ′END′
    10.     ′EOP′
TWICE DECLARED IDENTIFIER ′I′. NEXT STATEMENT IS   10/ 1
IDENTIFIER ′NOWHER′ IS NOT DECLARED. NEXT STATEMENT IS    9/ 1
IDENTIFIER ′P′ IS NOT DECLARED. NEXT STATEMENT IS    8/ 1
IDENTIFIER ′Z′ IS NOT DECLARED. NEXT STATEMENT IS    7/ 1
IDENTIFIER ′Y′ IS NOT DECLARED. NEXT STATEMENT IS    6/ 1
 * * INCORRECT ALGOL PROGRAM * *
